      "ui": {
        "label": "MiniMax-H3",
        "attribution": "Powered by MiniMax H3",
        "description": "MiniMax-H3 (Hailuo 3.0) generates video and synchronized stereo audio together in one pass — the clip arrives with its soundtrack already muxed, not dubbed on afterwards. Text-to-video plus first and/or last frame conditioning; there is no still-image mode, because the checkpoint refuses anything shorter than about five seconds. Clips come in fourteen fixed lengths between 5.17s and 14.38s at 24fps and nothing in between renders — including the 15s MiniMax's own documentation advertises, which is refused outright rather than quietly shortened to 14.38s. This is the open-weights model, not the hosted Hailuo product: the prompt-understanding front end (H3-Context-IR) and the 2K in-context upscaler (H3-Regenerate-2K) are not released, so prompt adherence differs from the API and 2K is not reachable from these weights. Attention runs dense by default. Optional Veda sparse attention uses the managed predictor and falls back to dense when it cannot run; the shortest dense clip at the default 1344x768 canvas is about a two-hour render, while the whole length range stays comfortable at 576x320. There is no guidance scale and no negative prompt — the model has neither axis, so those controls are hidden rather than missing. It renders through native MLX on Apple Silicon and Candle/CUDA on Windows and Linux; the measured q4, q8, and bf16 tiers require roughly 42 GB, 77 GB, and 69 GB of free VRAM respectively after the safety reserve.",
        "recommendedFor": [
          "text_to_video",
          "image_to_video",
          "first_last_frame"
        ],
        "durationHint": "Fourteen clip lengths only, 5.17s to 14.38s at 24fps — the frame lattice is 17n+5, so nothing in between renders, and 15s is refused rather than shortened to 14.38s. Cost is driven by CANVAS far more than by length: 5.17s at 576x320 is ~14 minutes and the whole 14.38s range is comfortable there, while 5.17s at the default 1344x768 is already ~2 hours. Pick the small canvas first, then the length.",
        "promptGuide": {
          "title": "MiniMax-H3 Prompt Guide",
          "path": "/prompt-guides/minimax-h3.md",
          "sources": [
            {
              "label": "MiniMax-H3 model card",
              "url": "https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3"
            },
            {
              "label": "Hailuo 3.0 prompting guide",
              "url": "https://hailuoai.video/"
            },
            {
              "label": "MiniMax platform video generation docs",
              "url": "https://platform.minimax.io/docs/api-reference/video-generation"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
